WEBVTT

00:17:29.593 --> 00:17:32.449
Not just to me or to my black students.

00:17:32.473 --> 00:17:33.902
But to all of us.

00:17:34.665 --> 00:17:37.371
You know, I think

00:17:37.395 --> 00:17:41.410
we're all connected by our inability
to talk about this word.

00:17:42.276 --> 00:17:45.189
But what if we explored
our points of encounter

00:17:45.213 --> 00:17:47.280
and did start to talk about it?

00:17:48.641 --> 00:17:51.991
Today, I try to create
the conditions in my classroom

00:17:52.015 --> 00:17:54.944
to have open and honest
conversations about it.

00:17:55.315 --> 00:17:58.355
One of those conditions --
not saying the word.

00:17:58.942 --> 00:18:00.268
We're able to talk about it